cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, cite Metria and cite the specific research report
  that supports any claim you rely on.
title: Metria
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Tharu Mahato
    given-names: Dipesh
    alias: dipeshbabu
repository-code: https://github.com/dipeshbabu/metria
url: https://github.com/dipeshbabu/metria
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A neutral evidence and experimentation layer for reproducible LLM inference
  systems studies, including runtime comparison, behavioral fidelity,
  performance measurement, hardware evidence, and research provenance.
keywords:
  - large language models
  - inference systems
  - benchmarking
  - evaluation
  - reproducible research
  - hardware
  - quantization
  - KV cache
